message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "tucc-chain-compile"
abstract: >-
  Compiles exact eigenstates into chains of primitive (rank <= 2)
  factorized unitary coupled-cluster factors, and translates those
  chains exactly to coupled-cluster amplitudes.
